  "worked_solution": "Since $X∼{χ}^{2}(6),$ we focus on the row of the table that corresponds to $k=6.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.995$ | $0.990$ | $0.975$ | $0.950$ | $0.900$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $6$ | $\\,0.676\\,$ | $\\,0.872\\,$ | $\\,1.237\\,$ | $\\,1.635\\,$ | $\\,2.204\\,$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X\\ge 1.635)=0.950.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=1.635.$",
